# Hashes for go-librespot.
#
# Buildroot 2026.05.2 downloads tag v0.9.0, runs `go mod vendor`, repacks the
# source and vendored modules, and then verifies this final cached archive. The
# `-go2` suffix is Buildroot's Go archive-format version (BR_FMT_VERSION_go),
# not the host Go release. The transient pre-vendoring GitHub archive is not a
# separately retained Buildroot download, so it intentionally has no entry.
